{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>את והב בסופה</b> — like יהב, and likewise הוה גביר like היה גביר. Meaning: that which was given to us בסופה, i.e., in speed, like כעבור סופה (Nahum 1:3) — in haste they acquired great wealth. And this is what is written במלחמות ה' — for it is written: רק הבהמה ושלל הערים בזזנו לנו (Numbers 31:53)." "<b>בסופה</b> — Two times: ואת והב בסופה, and the other: ובשערה דרכו. This is what Onkelos translated: בסופה — when they recall the miracles of ים סוף, for it is written: ה' בסופה וגו' (Psalms 77:19), and the end of that verse rebukes ים סוף and dries it up, and here too the matter concerns the drying up of ים סוף."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:45.491220462Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}